{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16126","headline":"送阿史那将军安西迎旧使灵榇 · 王建","name":"送阿史那将军安西迎旧使灵榇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉家都护边头没，旧将麻衣万里迎。\n阴地背行山下火，风天错到碛西城。\n单于送葬还垂泪，部曲招魂亦道名。\n却入杜陵秋巷里，路人来去读铭旌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16126.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16126","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}